Data from third-party sites
---------------------------

Test fixtures (files under any __fixtures__/ folder) hold trimmed copies of
responses and content from Sungkyunkwan University (SKKU), such as notices,
campus map buildings and places, shuttle timetables and cafeteria menus,
and of public transit services. They are captured so that the tests run
offline. That content belongs to its sources and stays under their terms.
Its presence here grants no license to it, and the Apache License does not
apply to it.

